  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1502.45 Owner",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1502.45 “Owner” means the person who holds record title to the property on which the work for which RSA 485-A:17 requires a permit has occurred or is proposed to occur.\n\nSource. #12342, eff 8-15-17; ss by #14472, eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES: 1-19-36 (formerly Env-Wq 1502.45); renumbered by #14656, eff 8-6-26, EXPIRES: 8-6-36 (formerly Env-Wq 1502.43)",
